{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>And Moshe reported.</b> Above it was fitting to say 'and he returned,' because it is a reply to what he asked them — 'if you will indeed obey,' etc. But here it says <b>ויגד</b> (reported) because it is the beginning of the matter, as Rashi explained: they said, 'Our wish is to see our King,' for every expression of הגדה applies to a matter that was not mentioned to the hearer."], :book :exodus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 19, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:58:47.783543411Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}